### অ্যাপের মধ্যে সম্পূর্ণ প্রসেস (Mobile App Flow)

```
[User opens "Chat Groups" Screen in App]
                   │
                   ▼ (1) Call API
       GET /api/v1/chats/groups
                   │
                   ▼ (2) Displays all Groups
 ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │  💬 Dubai Drivers Fleet       (3 Unread)  │
 │  💬 Airport Terminal Ops      (No unread) │
 │  💬 General Community                     │
 └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                   │
                   ▼ (3) User taps on a Group
    - Calls GET /api/v1/messages/:groupId (Load history)
    - Emits socket.emit('JOIN_CHAT', { chatId: groupId })
                   │
                   ▼ (4) Chat Screen opens
    - User sends message: POST /api/v1/messages/:groupId
    - Realtime message arrives via 'NEW_MESSAGE' socket
```

